{"id":"n67098-1-6","stage":0,"title":"엄마 · 妈妈","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n67098-1-6-1","ko":"엄마, 밥 주세요.","zh":"妈妈，给我饭吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"엄마,","meaning":"妈妈","explanation":"엄마：妈妈","readings":[{"term":"엄마","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67098","senseId":"1","lemma":"엄마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"밥","meaning":"饭","explanation":"밥：饭","readings":[{"term":"밥","audio":"/audio/828fa1e7e354b408527f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62683","senseId":"1","lemma":"밥","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"주세요.","meaning":"给予，给","explanation":"주다：给予，给；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"82136","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"9498f9014908e289","term":"엄마","zh":"妈妈","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3","entryId":"67098","definition":"在非正式场合用于指称或称呼母亲。","pronunciation":["엄마"]},{"id":"828fa1e7e354b408","term":"밥","zh":"饭","audio":"/audio/828fa1e7e354b408527f.mp3","entryId":"62683","definition":"在大米或其他谷物中倒入水后煮干至熟的食物。","pronunciation":["밥"]},{"id":"1b43f195318e9604","term":"주다","zh":"给予，给","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3","entryId":"82136","definition":"把东西等递给别人，让别人拥有或使用。","pronunciation":["주다"]}],"audio":"/audio/483f7e056139e5e47712.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n67098-1-6-2","ko":"다 됐으니까 손을 씻고 와.","zh":"都做好了，去洗洗手再过来。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"다","meaning":"全，都","explanation":"다：全，都","readings":[{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58175","senseId":"1","lemma":"다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"됐으니까","meaning":"顺利，不错","explanation":"되다：顺利，不错；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；으니까：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"13","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"손을","meaning":"手","explanation":"손：手；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"손","audio":"/audio/27d4fa6af704520dcfd6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17608","senseId":"1","lemma":"손","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"씻고","meaning":"洗，刷","explanation":"씻다：洗，刷；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"씻다","audio":"/audio/1fc19ed194af13383940.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17191","senseId":"1","lemma":"씻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"와.","meaning":"来，来到","explanation":"오다：来，来到；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"1","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"822b7db6f6886f57","term":"다","zh":"全，都","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3","entryId":"58175","definition":"无剩余或遗漏，所有的。","pronunciation":["다ː"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"顺利，不错","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"事情发展得很好。","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]},{"id":"27d4fa6af704520d","term":"손","zh":"手","audio":"/audio/27d4fa6af704520dcfd6.mp3","entryId":"17608","definition":"位于手腕的末端，用于摸某物或抓某物时使用的肢体中一部分。","pronunciation":["손"]},{"id":"1fc19ed194af1338","term":"씻다","zh":"洗，刷","audio":"/audio/1fc19ed194af13383940.mp3","entryId":"17191","definition":"除去污垢或脏的东西而使之干净。","pronunciation":["씯따"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"来，来到","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"从别的地方移动到这个地方。","pronunciation":["오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/1f2b17c4d7d856bff2e6.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":1.48,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=67098","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":9,"sequenceScore":0.2873,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options